WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:06.130
Girls Band Challenge

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:09.080
We'll begin accepting entries in October.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.750
Tokyo Live Music Association

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.750
Edogawa Music

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.750
Girls Band Challenge

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.750
Let's show our support for the female band scene!

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.750
Proposal by: Marina Tsukishima

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.880
We're making arrangements across
several venues to host the preliminaries.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.790
Tokyo Live Music Association

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.790
Edogawa Music

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.080
Are you sure about having the finals at CiRCLE?

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.630
Using the venue a second time
might not be very exciting...

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.630
Well, CiRCLE is the most popular venue in the area.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.210
And it's the perfect place for an event this size.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.630
What do you think, Owner?

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:41.630
Do as you all please. I'm just an advisor.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:45.750
However, in my opinion...

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.830
Is this the best you can come up with?

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:56.380
Um, about the finals...

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.630
Marina-chan?

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.250
We should book the Budokan!

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.040
The Budokan?!

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.710
Are you serious? For an unpaid event?

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.170
These girls work hard.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.670
I want them to stand on the stage of their dreams.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.750
You need an ultimate dream
to shoot for the stars!

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.540
Don't you think?

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:51.080
It's the Ultimate Dream, Don't You Think?!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:58.460
Cold...!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.040
How are you, Grandpa?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.250
I'm doin' just fine.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:21.250
It's beginning to feel like fall.
Sweater weather's already here.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:27.630
Summer went by in a flash, but
I had a great time!

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:33.000
I went to the pool with Asuka-chan and the others...

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:37.790
and we happened to run into
the Poppin' Party girls at a festival.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.290
Talk about luck!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:46.040
I heard Ako-chan went to the beach
with the other members of Roselia.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:50.250
Band camp at a seaside music studio...

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.080
Sounds nice, doesn't it?

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:57.960
Afterglow spent time at the library
working on their summer homework.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.380
I could relax in the cool air forever!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:06.710
The Hello, Happy World! girls
hung out somewhere kind of cold.

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.540
Yay!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:15.000
Pastel*Palettes went for a warmer destination instead.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.580
And then there's RAISE A SUILEN...

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.880
The band belongs to that girl
who showed up at PoPiPa's concert...

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.080
They're insanely popular right now.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.250
You better watch out,
'cause I'm gonna beat you to a pulp!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.330
Nobody's seen her since then...

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.250
What exactly did she mean by that...?

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.380
"Beat to a pulp"... A pulp?

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.750
Wham, bam!

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:46.750
Squish, squash!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.290
Wham, bam!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.960
Squish, squash, squish, squash!

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.830
Squish, squash, squish, squash!

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:58.170
She's gonna turn them into dango...?!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.500
Dango!

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.040
One skewer for each of you.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:09.210
Yay!

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.130
'Kay!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.830
Sorry about the noise.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.330
Don't worry. Besides, it's cold outside.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.420
You're all free to use the room whenever I'm here.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.630
Thank you!

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.630
Bliss...

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.080
Pure bliss!

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:27.380
Nice an' chewy...

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.290
Here, Saaya.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:29.460
Thanks.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.790
Arisa's in a good mood.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.250
Isn't it obvious?
She's excited to practice at the warehouse today.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:41.380
Bingo!

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:42.500
Don't "bingo" me!

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.960
But you woke up early for once.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.670
Besides, I'm excited too!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.670
It's been ages since we've
gone to the warehouse together.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.750
I wouldn't really say it's been that long...

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.920
And there's no Student Council meeting
after school today.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.250
It's my day off.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.130
Today works for me, too.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.250
You don't have extra lessons, do you, Rimi-rin?

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.330
Nope, I'm totally free.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.130
Let's hang out! Where should we go?!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.080
We're practicing at the warehouse, remember?

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.880
S-so cold...!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.580
Someone leave a window open?

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.460
Let's bring Arisa's kotatsu to school.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.380
Kotatsu!

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.580
And put it in the hallway?

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:23.500
The classroom!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.460
Good idea.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:25.250
Seriously?

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:26.830
Hold on...

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.790
Where do you think you're going?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:30.460
Isn't Class E that way?

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:33.580
I forgot...

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.210
O-Tae!

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.250
This warmth...

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.290
Let me in!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.040
There they go again...

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.130
Must be the cold...

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.830
Rimi-rin, Arisa!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.420
I have my own heater.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.210
Never a dull moment with those girls...

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.330
Happy!

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.380
Lucky!

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:52.960
Smile!

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.420
Yay!

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:55.790
Kokoro!

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.540
Do they ever stop bouncing off the walls?

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.040
Please take care.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.460
I thought that last girl was pretty good...

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:12.080
Hardly.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.000
RAISE A SUILEN is the ultimate band.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.920
Half-assed guitar? No, thank you!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:21.630
What, then? Do you plan on using
a backing track forever?

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.630
No, of course not.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:29.880
But if our guitarist can't even impress me
with their skills, we'll never beat Roselia to a pulp.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.210
I've been meaning to ask...

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.960
What is that supposed to mean?

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.250
I hope you aren't thinking of doing something risky.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.250
Of course!

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.790
I'm gonna show 'em who's boss!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.130
How exactly?

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.540
By unveiling the perfect performance!

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.710
I've seen off our guest.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:52.670
Regardless, the auditions will continue
until I can find the ultimate guitarist.

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:55.170
You two will concentrate on your lessons.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:56.920
Yes!

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:57.920
Gotcha.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:58.830
PAREO.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.080
Right, CHU2-sama! I'll go get your jerky.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.830
No! Send in the next guitar audition.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:04.830
Come on!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.290
I'm afraid our previous guest was the last one...

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:10.710
Really?!

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.170
Yamabuki Bakery

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.330
Practice at the warehouse!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.830
Just how many did you buy...?

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.630
I'm hungry...

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.670
And we figured one would be lonely by itself.

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:20.380
Lonely?

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:21.880
You mean the Michelle cakes?

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.460
Our newest fall creation!

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.920
Think LOCK is here?

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:28.420
Let's share some with her.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.000
Be back in a minute!

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.580
Wanna taste one of the Michelle cakes later?

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.710
Sure, thanks-

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.000
Kasumi-chan?!

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:37.750
What happened?!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.580
A mugger?!

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:40.330
I can't believe it!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:41.210
Whoa...

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.130
You guys...?

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.290
"BanG Dream"!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.880
The Budokan!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.960
Now Accepting Band Applications

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.960
Live at the Budokan!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.710
Says it right there! The Budokan!

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:56.540
Big Sis, the Budokan!

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.250
Quite the party, eh?

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.830
A party, indeed.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.880
Marina-san, is this...?

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:07.130
An event us staff from a few of the venues
around town put together.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.960
Took a bit of work to reserve the Budokan though.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.330
Nice job!

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.000
Isn't this amazing, Ran-chan?!

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.290
Yeah. But we'll have to stick it out until the finals.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.080
We're off to the Budokan!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.460
Alright...!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:24.500
Hip, hip, hooray!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.630
Hey! Why aren't you guys doing it with me?!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.540
Yukina-san, Yukina-san!
Hey! Why aren't you guys doing it with me?!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.040
Not interested.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.710
Huh?!
Aww!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.880
You're not going to enter?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.000
That's right.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:41.170
Preparations must be made for FUTURE WORLD FES.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.580
We don't have time to get hung up on this.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:44.920
Makes sense...

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.630
Really...?

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:49.040
Did you want to play at the Budokan, Ako?

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.330
It's the holy land for rock music, you know.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.540
Are you serious?!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.710
Aw, c'mon! Now we have to go!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:02.710
They picked Galaxy as one of the venues
for the preliminaries.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.130
I only just found out about it myself.

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.880
Can you believe it? The Budokan!

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:08.830
It's awesome.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.380
Insanely awesome!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:13.960
Says here the audience votes
for which bands move on to the finals.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.710
I wonder how many bands are going to participate...

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:20.250
Well?!

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:24.710
Arisa, you told us a while back
that you wanted to go to the Budokan!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:33.040
Must feel kinda nice to have
the same goal as someone else.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:39.420
Even aiming to perform at the Budokan someday
doesn't seem so bad...

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.420
That's not what I meant!

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.540
It's not?

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:48.420
I just thought it'd be nice
to share a goal with everyone...

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.420
Not like that!

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.630
Really?

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.040
I-I guess I wouldn't mind...

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.170
Let's do it!

00:10:57.080 --> 00:11:01.460
Whether we make it to the finals or not,
striving to get there together sounds fun.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.290
Yeah.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:04.790
Y-you think so?

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:05.920
Of course!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.580
Wh-what are you...?

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.460
H-hey...

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.500
Arisa.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.630
Arisa-chan!

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:12.750
Arisa!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:15.830
C'mon, Arisa!

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:16.790
Jeez...

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.170
Here we go!

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:21.170
Po-Pi-Pa! Pi-Po-Pa!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:24.000
Po-Pi-Pa-Pa-Pi-Po-Pa!

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.920
Let's go to the Budokan!

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:30.000
What about you, LOCK?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.830
Huh?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:35.040
How 'bout you join Poppin' Party
and go with us to the Budokan?

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.000
What?!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:40.210
No way! I could never join PoPiPa,
not in a million years!

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.330
Don'tcha wanna go to the Budokan?

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:44.380
It's not that I don't want to...

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:45.080
Then-

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.670
No way! I can't!

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.250
Although I appreciate the offer...

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.130
C'mon...!

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.000
Give it a rest.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:55.000
Thank you for your concern...

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.210
I suppose I haven't been able to
start a band of my own...

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.540
Sorry...

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.500
Oh, please don't apologize!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.290
You've been searching for members
ever since spring, haven't you?

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:05.460
Yes.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:09.080
At this point, I'm not sure if I'll ever start a band...

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:12.210
But you play the guitar so well...

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.420
You were incredible at the cultural festival.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.130
Are you sure you don't wanna join?

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.500
No, no, no!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.830
I hope you find members soon.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.960
Thank you very much!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.710
Catch you later!

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:27.750
Goodbye! Take care!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.750
They're so kind to me...

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.130
I adore them with all my heart!

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.460
Shoot for your dreams!

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:02.040
Bonjour, mademoiselle.

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.330
Forget I said that.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.080
W-wait a minute...!

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.920
Is that you, Masuki-san...?

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.420
There a problem?

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:23.330
I'm sorry! I've never seen you in your uniform before...

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.920
Oh, this?

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.670
I forgot you're a high school student...

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:27.500
What?

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.830
I'm sorry! That's not what I meant...!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.630
What's all this fighting about?

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:32.920
Nobody's fighting.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:34.460
Come on, Masuki-chan...

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:37.830
Your uniform will get wrinkled if you sit like that!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.170
That school isn't from around here, is it?

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.170
No.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:46.420
Shirayuki Academy is a prestigious prep school
catering to kindergarten through college-aged students.

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:51.040
A refined young lady who hangs around
her father's music venue...

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:54.500
A real-life princess locked away in a tower!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.880
Princess...

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:58.290
Oh, and Galaxy is the tower?

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.710
Precisely!

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.460
I'm gonna go bang out some tunes.

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:12.710
Your band seems to be doing well.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.790
"RAISE A SUILEN," wasn't it?

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.830
You can call it "RAS" for short.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.080
Huh?

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.750
That's right...

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.250
She was with the dango girl!

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:30.080
Sweet...

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:31.380
Excellent!

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:34.250
You sure do love Roselia, don't you, CHU2-sama?

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:35.290
No!

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:39.420
But you're always watching videos
of their performances.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:42.330
I am merely researching the enemy.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:46.750
True, they're both sweet and excellent...

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:50.170
But the stronger they are,
the sweeter my revenge will be!

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:54.580
We'll make our way to the top with the music we write.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.960
We don't need a producer.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.750
Yukina Minato...

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.880
How dare you make a fool out of me?!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.380
Methinks thou doth protest too much.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.880
No, PAREO!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.750
Go away and quit annoying me!

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.830
I promise I'll be good! Let me stay!

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:11.920
Jerky!

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:13.290
Yes, PAREO!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.250
Now, what's next?

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.790
"Cultural festival"...

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.710
A new video...?

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.670
I found her.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:50.920
Enjoy!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.420
Yum!
Thank you!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.880
A performance at the Budokan...!

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:56.460
You're getting ahead of yourself.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.670
Mental preparation is very important.

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:01.330
Seriously? I can't even picture it.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.880
I mean, the Budokan is like a dream come true.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:04.790
Exactly!

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.670
BanG! Dream!

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:09.080
You got me...

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.920
Huh? Uh...

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.290
Oh, if only I could have seen my sister one last time...

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.210
Slump.

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.290
Rimi-rin! Saaya!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.630
You're under arrest!

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.000
Please forgive me!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:20.830
Is that what "BanG Dream" is supposed to mean...?
Please forgive me!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.130
Is that what "BanG Dream" is supposed to mean...?

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:24.500
I'm begging you! It was an accident!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.710
Sorry to interrupt all the fun!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:28.960
It's her!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.210
Thank you for the lovely introduction.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:33.580
We have an intruder!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:37.630
I entered through the front gate.
Your grandmother graciously showed me the way.

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:41.460
You have my deepest apologies
for this unexpected rendezvous.

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:42.710
This what?

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.210
Fancy way of saying "meeting."

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:45.210
Oh...

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.790
PAREO...

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:48.540
What do you want this time?

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.250
There's no need to be concerned!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.880
I've merely come to deliver this.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.130
Thanks...

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.830
I'll be on my way.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.960
It's nice to meet you!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:16.420
Haven't we... met before?

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:18.830
I'm honored that you remember me!

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:23.750
But just in case, my name is PAREO.
I'm CHU2-sama's keyboard maid!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:25.960
Hello there! I'm-

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:27.460
Rokka Asahi-sama.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:28.290
Huh?

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:31.830
Born on July 17th. Cancer, Type A.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.670
Hailing from Gifu Prefecture.

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.170
You've been living and working at
this bathhouse since the spring.

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:39.790
You clean the baths in the morning,
go to school during the day, and at night-

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.290
H-how do you...?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.960
I did my research!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.000
Here's your invitation.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:47.210
Invitation?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:52.080
We'll show you a stage
the likes of which you've never seen.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.170
Poppin' Party will be in attendance as well.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.290
PoPiPa?!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.420
Goodbye.

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:02.330
Th-thank you very much!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.920
That caught me off guard...

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.000
A ticket for...

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:17.880
a RAS solo performance?!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.790
This place is packed!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.460
Their last show was packed, but this is insane.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.880
Saaya and the others should be here soon.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:35.880
'Kay.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.500
Hey there!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.960
Oh, you made it. Just you?

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:44.630
The others are on their way.

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:47.170
Did you guys get an invitation, too?

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.040
Roselia got one, too?!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:50.000
Yes.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.500
More than one, unfortunately...

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:58.000
Although I am curious about these supposed
"new leaders of the Girl Band Generation."

00:18:58.210 --> 00:19:00.500
Girl Band Generation...?

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.790
New leaders...?

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.290
Sorry I'm late.

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.580
O-Tae!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.000
Where are Rimi and Saaya?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.540
Checking out the merch.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.250
Hello there.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.080
LOCK! What are you doing back there?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:18.330
Tae-senpai came to my rescue
when I was drowning in the sea of people...

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.790
Fished her right out.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:22.290
Honestly, I wasn't sure whether to come or not.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.290
But they went out of their way to invite me...

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.540
You, too?!

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:26.380
Yes...

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.080
What is she playing at...?

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:33.920
Come into the world
Come into the world

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:39.460
Oritatsu sugata wa zetsudai na kagayaki no fantastic art
The descension of massive, shining, fantastic art

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.830
Shikou no ongaku o ajiwae to
Taste my sublime music

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:46.170
Let me show you yoishirereba ii
Let me show you, let it intoxicate you

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:55.330
Bokura no oto wa sekai e to hyoui suru
We'll possess this world with our sound

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.750
So cool!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:04.380
RAS! RAS! RAS!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:07.250
RAS! RAS!

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:10.460
For real? This is better than I expected.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:13.080
They used a backing track for the guitar, didn't they?

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:16.290
Yes. Even so, it had no negative impact
on their performance.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:19.630
They're incredible...

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:20.710
Yeah...

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:26.330
Tae-senpai... You played on the same stage as them?

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:47.710
Yay, KING!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:04.750
Hello, everyone!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.750
Hello, CHU2!

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.420
Okay, okay.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:13.330
Before we start the encore,
I've got a sweet announcement!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:20.960
My band, RAISE A SUILEN, is going to perform
in the "BanG Dream! Girls Band Challenge"!

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.000
Okay, okay.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.380
Now here's the important part...

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.250
At this BanG Dream...

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:32.460
we're going to beat Roselia and PoPiPa to a pulp!

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:33.580
Huh?!

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:40.830
The dango...!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.960
And to do that...

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:44.630
Huh?!

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:48.380
Rokka Asahi, I'm scouting you!

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:36.750
Next Time: Scared to Death
